                                                "sense_id": "07c1341c-ca96-35f3-a331-844707651bbd",
                                                "text": "It was the first day of term, and one of the rare days in Oxford when the weather was deceitfully marvellous; when its warmth promised more sunshine and joy than the relentless rain and sleet Hilary inevitably brought."
